  "prefLabel": "Alc 103.01 Composition of the Board",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Alc 103.01 Composition of the Board. The board consists of 7 members appointed and limited in accordance with RSA 330-C:3, I through XVI, sitting for no more than 2 consecutive 3-year terms.\n\nSource. #8169, eff 9-21-04; ss by 9417, eff 3-14-09; ss by #14585, eff 6-1-26",
